      en: "Orhei-Vit is the leading producer of juices and baby food in the Republic of Moldova, with a history that began in 1945. The company operates modern production facilities in Orhei and Causeni, equipped with state-of-the-art technology for fruit and vegetable processing. With an annual production capacity of over 75 million liters of juice, Orhei-Vit is a key player in both domestic and international markets. Its product range includes more than 200 items, such as juices, nectars, jams, and canned vegetables, sold under well-known brands like 'Vita' and 'Naturalis'. The company exports its products to over 25 countries, including Germany, Romania, the USA, and China. Orhei-Vit possesses its own agricultural land of more than 1,000 hectares, enabling strict control over raw material quality. Adherence to international standards like ISO 22000 and FSSC 22000 guarantees the highest food safety. Through constant innovation and investment, the company remains competitive and supports the Moldovan agricultural economy.",
